exports[`locale-aware formatting > locale snapshots > email template renders for de-DE > email--de-DE 1`] = `
"Subject: Wave 3 Payout Readiness Check

Dear Alice,

Thank you for being part of the TrustBridge Wave 3!

To ensure you receive your payout successfully, please complete the following checklist by 1. August 2026:

**Step 1: Fund Your Stellar Account**
- Ensure your Stellar G-address has at least 1,5 XLM for transaction fees and reserves
- You can purchase XLM from any Stellar-supported exchange

**Step 2: Set Up USDC Trustline**
- Log into your Stellar wallet (Lobstr, Stellar.Expert, or similar)
- Add a trustline for USDC from issuer: GA5ZSEJYB37JRC5AVCIA5MOP4RHTM335X2KGX3IHOJAPP5RE34K4KZVN
- Mark the trustline as authorized if your wallet prompts you

**Step 3: Verify via TrustBridge Dashboard**
- Visit: https://trustbridge.dev/dashboard
- Sign in with your GitHub account
- Check that your status shows "Ready" (✅)

**Wallet Proof (if requested)**
- Screenshot your Stellar account showing:
  - Your public address (G-address)
  - XLM balance ≥ 1,5
  - Active USDC trustline with authorization status

**Need Help?**
If you encounter any issues, please:
1. Check the TrustBridge docs: https://docs.trustbridge.dev
2. Review common issues: https://docs.trustbridge.dev/troubleshooting
3. Contact support: help@example.com

We look forward to Wave 3!

Best regards,
The TrustBridge Team"
`;

