exports[`locale-aware formatting > locale snapshots > markdown template renders for de-DE > markdown--de-DE 1`] = `
"# Wave 3 Payout Readiness

Hi Alice! 👋

Thank you for being part of Wave 3. To receive your payout, complete this checklist by **1. August 2026**:

## ✅ Checklist

### 1. Fund Your Stellar Account
- [ ] Stellar account has ≥ 1,5 XLM
- [ ] XLM covers transaction fees and reserves

### 2. Set Up USDC Trustline
- [ ] Added trustline for USDC
- [ ] Issuer: \`GA5ZSEJYB37JRC5AVCIA5MOP4RHTM335X2KGX3IHOJAPP5RE34K4KZVN\`
- [ ] Trustline is authorized

### 3. Verify on TrustBridge
- [ ] Open https://trustbridge.dev/dashboard
- [ ] Dashboard shows status: **Ready** ✅
- [ ] Last checked: Today or recent

## 📸 Wallet Proof

If requested, provide a screenshot showing:
- Your Stellar public address
- XLM balance ≥ 1,5
- USDC trustline (authorized)

## 🆘 Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Low XLM balance | Purchase XLM from an exchange |
| Can't add trustline | Check wallet supports USDC |
| Trustline unauthorized | Contact issuer to authorize |

**Questions?** → help@example.com"
`;

